Scope and limitations
---------------------
The new material is formal and local at infinity only. It proves no
convergence, Gevrey order, analytic sectorial existence, remainder estimate,
Stokes multiplier, connection formula, Bargmann admissibility, eigenvalue,
quantization condition, determinant, or eigenvalue asymptotic. Actual
solutions and remainder control are reserved for stage 07d as far as this
stage is concerned. Existing later manuscript material was not modified or
reasserted by this stage.

No continued fraction, eigenvalue calculation, spectral determinant,
quantization condition, Stokes multiplier, global connection matrix,
connection-problem solution, large-parameter scaling, Fedoryuk analysis, or
prohibited method/computation was introduced. The stage-07a/07b figure was
not modified because no inconsistency was found.
